---
// The small mark before the site name in the top bar: Cormorant's fleuron in the accent.
// Decorative: it sits inside the home link, whose name is the tagline, so it is hidden from
// assistive tech. The fleuron is accent-text on paper and accent-bright on the dark bar.
---

<span class="site-mark" aria-hidden="true">❦</span>

<style>
  /* The name hangs beside the mark when it wraps on a phone. */
  :global(*:has(> .site-mark)) {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .site-mark {
    flex: none;
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    line-height: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  :global(html[data-menu='open']) .site-mark,
  :global(html[data-drawer-open]) .site-mark {
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }
</style>
